ns in giant cell arteritis. <source>Arthritis Rheum.</source> <volume>41</volume>:<fpage>623</fpage>&#x02013;633.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9550471</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal">Kaiser, M., B. Younge, J. Bjornsson, J.J. Goronzy, and C.M. Weyand. <year>1999</year>. Formation of new vasa vasorum in vasculitis. Production of angiogenic cytokines by multinucleated giant cells. <source>Am. J. Pathol.</source> <volume>155</volume>:<fpage>765</fpage>&#x02013;774.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10487834</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal">Borkowski, A., B.R. Younge, L. Szweda, B. Mock, J. Bjornsson, K. Moeller, J.J. Goronzy, and C.M. Weyand. <year>2002</year>. Reactive nitrogen intermediates in giant cell arteritis: selective nitration of neocapillaries. <source>Am. J. Pathol.</source> <volume>161</volume>:<fpage>115</fpage>&#x02013;123.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12107096</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib14"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal">Weyand, C.M., N. Tetzlaff, J. Bjornsson, A. Brack, B. Younge, and J.J. Goronzy. <year>1997</year>. Disease patterns and tissue cytokine profiles in giant cell arteritis. <source>Arthritis Rheum.</source> <volume>40</volume>:<fpage>19</fpage>&#x02013;26.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9008596</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib15"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal">Krupa, W.M., M. Dewan, M.S. Jeon, P.J. Kurtin, B.R. Younge, J.J. Goronzy, and C.M. Weyand. <year>2002</year>. Trapping of misdirected dendritic cells in the granulomatous lesions of giant cell arteritis. <source>Am. J. Pathol.</source> <volume>161</volume>:<fpage>1815</fpage>&#x02013;1823.<pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12414528</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib16"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal">Weyand, C.M., and J.J. Goronzy. <year>2000</year>. Pathogenic principles in giant cell arteritis. <source>Int. J. Cardio